  "body": "Brand new coastal elegance with sea views!  Architecturally designed by the award-winning Herbst Architects, this brand-new apartment is seriously for sale and now is the time to make your move. \r\n\r\nAt 142sqm (more or less), this luxurious apartment is superbly proportioned and offers three generous bedrooms with excellent storage in all, two beautifully appointed bathrooms plus a separate powder room. Sunlight streams through the interiors, while the open-plan living area and designer kitchen flow seamlessly to a north-facing balcony with wide sea views. \r\n \r\nLocated in the heart of Mairangi Bay, just a short stroll to the beach, this sub-penthouse in the highly sought-after Waipapa building is arguably one of the best floorplans in this boutique building of only 18 residences.  \r\n \r\nKey Features \r\n•Prime Mairangi Bay address with ocean views \r\n•Three spacious bedrooms, two bathrooms + powder room \r\n•Two secure side-by-side carparks with two storage units and EV charging \r\n•Separate laundry/utility room with extensive storage \r\n•Architecturally designed by award-winning Herbst Architects \r\n•Secure access, lifts, and residents-only courtyard \r\n \r\nEverything you could want in an apartment is here.  This is your final opportunity to secure this stunning apartment.  \r\n \r\nWhat our happy owners love about living at Waipapa:\r\n \r\n\"Living at Waipapa has been a great experience. We love the convenience of apartment living, the friendly community, and being so close to everything Mairangi Bay has to offer. The beach, cafes, and village atmosphere are all just a short walk away. It feels secure, welcoming, and easy to live here, and we feel very fortunate to call Waipapa home.\" Gavin & Robyn \r\n \r\n\"Waipapa is a special place. The stylish apartment interior with its high ceilings and wide corridors give a spatial energy.  My East facing terrace welcomes the morning sun and the West facing deck brings the splendour of the sunset. \r\nThe sense of community in the complex makes me feel safe and secure and to top it off - glorious Mairangi Bay beach is a two minute walk away. Heavenly. I love living here.\" Coralie \r\n\r\n**OPEN HOMES - We will meet you at the doors from the walkway. If we are not there, we will be taking another party into the apartments, please call us on the numbers on the signboard to let us know you are there.",
